  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For tossing two coins independently, maximum and minimum heads that can appear will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively.</p><p>Roots of equation <math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math> are real and equal, then discriminant <math> <mrow> <mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Thus, the required probability</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>9</mn> </mfrac> <mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac> <mn>4</mn> <mn>9</mn> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>4</mn> <mn>9</mn> </mfrac> <mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac> <mn>4</mn> <mn>9</mn> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>20</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mn>81</mn></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math></p>",
